  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "list_t",
   "x": 58,
   "y": 684,
   "width": 1630,
   "height": 340,
   "text": " 1 say        TUI POSTs /api/act?$=say with the text as body. Views.apply runs each act id only once.\n 2 log        Chat.say \u2192 Chat.push \u2192 Memory.push: appended to main/, sent to every TUI as 'entry'.\n 3 settle     Chat.take \u2192 Chat.turn \u2192 Chat.call. Memory.settle waits until older messages have leaf lines.\n 4 ask        blocks = Memory.view + devices + agents at work + 'Turn: ...' + new text. AskAI.ask \u2192 Agent.ask.\n 5 tools/list Agent.server: JSON-RPC to the chat's own MCP URL \u2192 zoom, date, spawn, tell, shell, read, write, edit, computer.\n 6 POST       AskAI.wait (single flight per cache prefix) \u2192 wire.body \u2192 fetch(wire.url). Up to 8 tries if busy.\n 7 stream     Agent.stream \u2192 wire.read per SSE event \u2192 Delta \u2192 Chat.on \u2192 'delta' to every TUI. Each finished\n              reply / tool call / result is logged to main/ at once.\n 8 tools/call stop = tools \u2192 Agent.use \u2192 Agent.call (JSON-RPC) \u2192 Tools.call.\n 9 job        Tools.job \u2192 start_job: {$:'job'} on the socket of a terminal of that device.\n10 out        client_run \u2192 Machine.run ($SHELL -c 'bun test ...') \u2192 act 'out' \u2192 Tools.done \u2192 JSON-RPC answer.\n11 result     a Back item. Messages you typed meanwhile (run.sent) join as a User item right here.\n12 POST again same prefix + the new tail \u2192 cache hit on the prefix. Go back to 7.\n13 end_turn   no tool calls and nothing new sent \u2192 End {ok}. (/goal set? a no-tools 'yes/no' check runs.)\n14 idle       Chat.turn ends: state goes to every TUI; the 'after' shell command runs if set.\n15 compact    the new messages over 512 B, and new sibling pairs, become compaction jobs (background).",
   "originalText": " 1 say        TUI POSTs /api/act?$=say with the text as body. Views.apply runs each act id only once.\n 2 log        Chat.say \u2192 Chat.push \u2192 Memory.push: appended to main/, sent to every TUI as 'entry'.\n 3 settle     Chat.take \u2192 Chat.turn \u2192 Chat.call. Memory.settle waits until older messages have leaf lines.\n 4 ask        blocks = Memory.view + devices + agents at work + 'Turn: ...' + new text. AskAI.ask \u2192 Agent.ask.\n 5 tools/list Agent.server: JSON-RPC to the chat's own MCP URL \u2192 zoom, date, spawn, tell, shell, read, write, edit, computer.\n 6 POST       AskAI.wait (single flight per cache prefix) \u2192 wire.body \u2192 fetch(wire.url). Up to 8 tries if busy.\n 7 stream     Agent.stream \u2192 wire.read per SSE event \u2192 Delta \u2192 Chat.on \u2192 'delta' to every TUI. Each finished\n              reply / tool call / result is logged to main/ at once.\n 8 tools/call stop = tools \u2192 Agent.use \u2192 Agent.call (JSON-RPC) \u2192 Tools.call.\n 9 job        Tools.job \u2192 start_job: {$:'job'} on the socket of a terminal of that device.\n10 out        client_run \u2192 Machine.run ($SHELL -c 'bun test ...') \u2192 act 'out' \u2192 Tools.done \u2192 JSON-RPC answer.\n11 result     a Back item. Messages you typed meanwhile (run.sent) join as a User item right here.\n12 POST again same prefix + the new tail \u2192 cache hit on the prefix. Go back to 7.\n13 end_turn   no tool calls and nothing new sent \u2192 End {ok}. (/goal set? a no-tools 'yes/no' check runs.)\n14 idle       Chat.turn ends: state goes to every TUI; the 'after' shell command runs if set.\n15 compact    the new messages over 512 B, and new sibling pairs, become compaction jobs (background).",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
